Package: klabctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash
Description: multi-node Kubernetes labs on Multipass
 klabctl creates production-like kubeadm clusters on local Multipass
 VMs. The default Kubernetes minor is 1.36. Targeted minors are 1.35,
 1.36, and 1.37.
